            "value" : "上次備份未完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac compares photos taken within a minute of each other, using the backed-up copies. Nothing leaves this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Mac vergleicht Fotos, die innerhalb einer Minute aufgenommen wurden, anhand der gesicherten Kopien. Nichts verlässt diesen Mac."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Mac compara las fotos tomadas con menos de un minuto de diferencia, usando las copias. Nada sale de este Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le Mac compare les photos prises à moins d’une minute d’intervalle, à partir des copies sauvegardées. Rien ne quitte ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il Mac confronta le foto scattate a meno di un minuto l’una dall’altra, usando le copie di backup. Niente lascia questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Macは、バックアップされたコピーを使って、1分以内に撮影された写真を比較します。このMacの外には何も出ません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac이 백업된 사본을 사용해 1분 이내에 찍은 사진을 비교합니다. 이 Mac 밖으로 나가는 것은 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Mac compara fotos tiradas com menos de um minuto de diferença, usando as cópias com backup. Nada sai deste Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 会用已备份的拷贝，比较一分钟内拍摄的照片。任何内容都不会离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 會用已備份的拷貝，比較一分鐘內拍攝的照片。任何內容都不會離開這部 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their backups on this Mac go straight to Recently Deleted, where you can put them back for %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Backups auf diesem Mac kommen direkt in „Zuletzt gelöscht“, wo du sie %@ zurücklegen kannst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus copias en este Mac van directas a Eliminado, donde puedes recuperarlas durante %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leurs sauvegardes sur ce Mac vont directement dans Suppressions récentes, où vous pouvez les remettre pendant %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I loro backup su questo Mac vanno direttamente in Eliminati di recente, dove puoi ripristinarli per %@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このMac上のバックアップはそのまま「最近削除した項目」に移り、%@戻すことができます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에 있는 백업은 바로 최근 삭제된 항목으로 이동하며, %@ 동안 되돌려 놓을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os backups deles neste Mac vão direto para Apagados, onde você pode recuperá-los por %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们在这台 Mac 上的备份会直接移到“最近删除”，你可以在%@内放回原处。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它們在這部 Mac 上的備份會直接移到「最近刪除」，你可以在%@內放回原處。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their backups stay on this Mac, and the bell asks whether to delete them here too, keep them, or put them back on the iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Backups bleiben auf diesem Mac, und die Glocke fragt, ob du sie hier auch löschen, behalten oder zurück aufs iPhone legen möchtest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus copias se quedan en este Mac, y la campana pregunta si eliminarlas aquí también, conservarlas o devolverlas al iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leurs sauvegardes restent sur ce Mac, et la cloche demande s’il faut les supprimer ici aussi, les garder, ou les remettre sur l’iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I loro backup restano su questo Mac, e la campanella chiede se eliminarli anche qui, tenerli o rimetterli sull’iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バックアップはこのMacに残り、ここでも削除するか、残すか、iPhoneに戻すかをベルが確認します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "백업은 이 Mac에 유지되며, 벨이 여기에서도 삭제할지, 유지할지, iPhone에 되돌려 놓을지 묻습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os backups deles ficam neste Mac, e o sino pergunta se deve apagá-los aqui também, mantê-los ou devolvê-los ao iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们的备份会保留在这台 Mac 上，铃铛会询问是否也在这里删除、保留，或放回 iPhone。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它們的備份會保留在這部 Mac 上，鈴鐺會詢問是否也在這裡刪除、保留，或放回 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then a one-time unlock keeps backups going." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Danach hält eine einmalige Freischaltung die Backups am Laufen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después, un desbloqueo único mantiene las copias en marcha."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ensuite, un déverrouillage unique poursuit les sauvegardes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poi uno sblocco una tantum fa proseguire i backup."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "その後は一度ロックを解除すれば、バックアップを続けられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "그 후에는 한 번만 잠금 해제하면 백업이 계속됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depois, um desbloqueio único mantém os backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后一次性解锁即可继续备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之後一次性解鎖即可繼續備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's already a folder named “%@” in “%@”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In „%2$@“ gibt es bereits einen Ordner namens „%1$@“."
